{"id": "EUVD-2026-93390", "enisaUuid": "36a52a44-61fc-3ace-a82d-4a4f61e791a0", "description": "libmikmod before 3.3.14 contains a heap out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the Impulse Tracker loader load_it.c that allows attackers to read adjacent heap memory via oversized patterns. Attackers can supply a crafted IT module with more than 200 pattern rows, causing IT_ConvertTrack() to read past the itpat buffer and crash applications.", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T13:35:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-06T17:14:37", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/sezero/mikmod/commit/e7c6c9e88fbe3e8af4668a2e116bb8de341383f8", "https://github.com/sezero/mikmod/blob/libmikmod-3.3.13/libmikmod/loaders/load_it.c#L198", "https://github.com/sezero/mikmod/blob/libmikmod-3.3.14/libmikmod/NEWS", "https://github.com/sezero/mikmod", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libmikmod-before-3.3.14-heap-out-of-bounds-read-via-it-module-loader"], "aliases": ["GHSA-xrff-r355-6xmr", "CVE-2026-105838"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0f0f4108-fe9a-3b62-bf48-afcb6a1fe259", "product": {"name": "libmikmod", "vendor": {"name": "sezero"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.3.14"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "d71d2473-7808-3939-bcd4-f718c2a29125", "vendor": {"name": "sezero"}}], "isExploited": false}